{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1540,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aec1d8eb48c714bc3b2f170",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多到采蘑菇的好季节了……\n那种像是在山里探险寻宝的感觉\n真让人兴奋啊。你能懂吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "11aaf5db66129d7704d9d68f68288167575e01254150a39af16c4869c29be194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:024280b8095e14f067e57b1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你见过漫天雪景吗？\n真想让你体验一下……双脚踏入\n纯白地毯时的那种雀跃感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e239caec5dd614f1377ce43c9c8f930e2f532c210024cfbef4ecc8817f60019c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efa36e562c9104eb27900fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，开心地做吧。\n旅行的醍醐味，\n可是全都蕴含在过程之中哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f460539de7250a7fba6eb3fa0b9ac1a6cf831dfc6c240943f5a5b994f7d76b20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a2ddc417c0a86ef58cc601d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，今天的训练\n会发生什么呢……让我们试试看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "937978700aa8cfc1e69bc64d6da774682787ff2fd1ab6cc94a521b1eea0490d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff5c4af0e54e6f0dfff88813",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "慢悠悠地开始吧。……放心，\n我不会偷懒的。毕竟我也一样，\n渴望一场有趣的较量啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54b173d535d3d475893f2573454357e56d344201b4de5f878af5f0864509b04e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c53189d84caf2f0bf1823c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔——天气真好，空气也清新……\n在外面跑跑也不错……虽然我也可能\n就那样直接去旅行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e3576ad0bb4143a4476e57e7f59910c4b689c81c8d7878b9c995dda2eecb1e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8cc4aaa9541967ff0993e6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你正兴奋着呢。\n挺好。对于旅行的伙伴来说，\n那可是必不可少的要素。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26bcdc1801b270f46ed1ee5b1068cf74280f2d40785a4ffeb2f0f629eab423ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b1955d2b4fccfbdee8b3403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与你的这场旅行，究竟会抵达何方呢\n……真想在这漫长的途中，\n彻底品味个够啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "148ceb3f89c41384f752f80885ff65db703ae90f937eb2be7a4244e67fc71eab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a11c39ace62622d1734dbe86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旅途要有伴……虽然不知道\n是谁说的——但和你在一起，\n我也明白这句话的意思了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97bb8d3572653fbf84b2803aa55b16a8c548e0f4bbb212da23e909ee06829879",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab55512ad1f1963dde35d50d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热……不过，真是个不错的地方。\n等太阳下山后，我们去看看\n海岸线到底延伸到哪儿了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b74f56aab0f57788b1a728e9434ad6827c7cf811d18938c7d9b7e1d3122b3b57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8f0372164922f4e50656711",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，接下来要去哪里呢……你会来的吧？当然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b1a5757a725c4eeea1e1f9769ce9070132c0bd0dd363578c5d906380ea3782d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe039529a60b6815e88f2e64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会忘记的。那是一段，绝佳的旅程。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d4d0d618859e5d0a22bccac654c83f69fb7993057b7acf893306ffee9c59a67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fced84b276e4b83c48c64684",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旅途的终点……或许能看见呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddc3b3d027b5cb72f8db5050596f90d1f9289a8e6874fb49f727807becbd399b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a03ae68b23deaed241d90f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以说是，新的旅途已经开启了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99419fde5f5e0dbcffb1b91bc6ce21b8e59b8007af0171ec9a0b00adcf226861",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a3876bf303c001eba265e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是黄金旅程。让我们来一场精彩的旅行吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ac89d8492d98590b73277067b6a60b94b8c8e6982c4f10adce0b75ea6a879d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81838e1c310df75349ced86f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么——这次又会抵达何方呢？\n要跟上来吗？跟上这趟黄金之旅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5e85c44596d5a36f1a36986e58725c296f369993fc1f59026fd580936f1e224",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da9607f28c0be606e89f973d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，下一个目的地是……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c42853f960d447d4578474f66f48bf0f3f45c7c932fd933b6502ec396e3b7af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:498cdba7304f7fbf5413d657",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看看能走到哪儿去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7814c8b7b8f2b70978433d3e102c37461592ccb2d9f881c4b9c2297fdb9bee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4896f04cb5868c87b8c3068",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将祝福献予您——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7b0a404b38117afd90b2aac4d2e7980cdc18d90b1f08fe49e1da83bfcfd7739",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0423f5162608388e4c653a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请带我，从这里离开——",
      "source_fingerprint": "446b57faf1e5047bc5b366a4cca7d7b951d54303f5510ce8e732c1dd08598107",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6ab84aaabf8d25352b09007",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，我感受到了这份祝福……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1abe076962eeb99994beea972a1e236585b7bb2ee242412be0246ffdd4582bb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b06553fd2b00d732f23850",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃烧灵魂吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6846dad93f42057268ccf63695969cbbf6fa646e5ee71bd5310467eb45a72e0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70dc07b5f8ae42865b8fc27e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么你总是对我抱有那么多的\r\n期待呢……呜——我当然会\r\n回应你的啦，那是肯定的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f435bfc40745c5cb4a2e7547ab1a9cd096162280936fb8765f947ec3e0b8033",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d92275a6b4ed3370bb2bc9e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a81719318f354a289fa32effff3e0060c6af596527f262f806d5f1b7f27b877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab5791d61b4c15136bd19f56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcca0a999319539ad9640b8787eee70f6962f780c51356ce460851b0dce71db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ad733a8d94841738b56df6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要不要去看看漫画改编的舞台剧？\r\n……我觉得如果是和你一起去的话，\r\n一定会是一次愉快的体验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4178b17350d67ec34dd39361b92f261ab995315fcdbabdffde165ae0652a8ca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b485cf9045f14c1e9b27e2a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次可以COS一下敌方组织的杀手吗？\n就是穿着金闪闪的西装，\n还带着刺刺护肩的那种！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed0016baacc2c4cdcbf172de6803e80ddafac6f7cf4b3ec3e14d63922a9488bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92935574bfea4e7510d28d59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新·章·突·入！\r\n带着全新的必杀技，展现出与\r\n更加强大的强敌战斗的身姿吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c0e35668f2a6785f1a7e80c9db49469a932f6d27cca14aa42af2ff2dc98e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0efbeb6f6364de26f1f724f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，要不要去看看储物柜？\r\n谁柜子里有巧克力谁就算赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85e7bfe258da2cab22360f9bf4eb92dfaa89ffe3f262f68193b35970964dc628",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a4c2a4c3c79fbdfd066840c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请用纸杯蛋糕！哼……这可是注入了\r\n常人无法承受之『念』的佳作……\r\n你能全部吃完吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f71a9ff6fc22a82be566550dde8adac8f9cb7c4e119ff8116fcd47a3ae23eeda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93b6dde9125437f0c06f2282",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果想要跨越银河，只要张开想象的翅膀\r\n飞翔就好。只要愿望足够强烈，\r\n哪怕是银河的彼端也一定能到达！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccddc22838bcd08fa0ebc841726b836824b74e6b29196278d01d7aafe53818f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:635a380822a7113c8d6b661d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "满大街都是各种作品的COS呢……\r\n总有一天，我的作品也一定能\r\n名列其中……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a51cd038a0840a09106a7cd5e57ea7cc8e651024a4eff5a1bab01a5c8e914141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46ac2b4f220343c897a292cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我要去参加气槽前辈主持的\r\n派对！有蛋糕还有桌游，\r\n好期待呀～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a91a215e1790c0505a9451a6dbcb72fc19218ca050019ecc3a86b434e8cee1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5eb19340a08d88fa86176cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前收到的画具套装，现在是不是\r\n还在抽屉里呢。久违地试用一下吧……\r\n那盒20色的蜡笔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "971c745c1ff38db2be7187f6aad0a5f79fb0aefda2544018e28d124d103e3d5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:198c9203ca0a7b32f0f00659",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe7548f6a96c3ffbb15ebb1881687fdb27f8c9371c23aa3dfef656a536ac829",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef33a332864ca498542a6c60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有好多仅限年内免费畅读的内容……！\r\n手机、平板还有电脑……\r\n全部用上的话应该能看完！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a5f953a864c58f3b377c0321d3c28d45717de1a8433b8c96352049f42b64c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcd61eed9c9389a6f905d30d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了庆祝生日我做了『漫画肉』哦♪\r\n用了专门的骨头，在大小、魄力\r\n还有画力表现上都非常讲究呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a17ab6035642c7cb3d777b8c66b0d00a0f24f24461a2a8c966120c9a208f4e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b97ac4ef0b9d8d3603d9f34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要打篮球吗？还是要进行异能战斗？\r\n或者是料理对决？今天你才是\r\n主人公！无论什么我都会陪你的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "258709579de3f8759e2ad7898dd2582c6db5f4eb225ec61a47b55df22f604d83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4bf40323b0af0e45eb083b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给明年的自己，写一封信吧……\r\n——现在的你，\r\n有没有比当时离梦想更近一步了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8a95f486be27b92fb75232861d70d8f4520cfe9a4131e5e5598d9e9f8ef47c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de15e3e8138095e3c593402b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想看看你画的画。\r\n请务必让我见识一下，\r\n你内心深处藏着的那些雀跃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14feef9fef88917ac50d95da71650d9a0400dff19c13c00d001f737283521d04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f77cb9645259f6bac52e6c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到通知了。\r\n难道是喜欢的漫画更新\r\n最新一话了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad3fc84f3d6fdfe33c429cfaae2f1a4a27139cfd126f53d5b9a6743719da9ecd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96590263e1e182830f7e4280",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了哦。要是能让创作\r\n变得更顺利的道具就好了呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "273ffad159092d78deea219d971462d6c909c167cbd9e0f24c9ca8001b4033c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
