      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我们兄弟姐妹全员都会穿\r\n一样的衣服。就是那种设计相同、\r\n颜色不一的套装！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc091a0c54adedd93fef7dbe403fee7073e256662314e7e6640a66aa4feae714",
